mindmap
  root((Scheduler))
    Correctness
      PostgreSQL is the single source of truth
      Exclusion constraints block overlaps
      Half-open intervals
    Performance
      Redis cache-aside for availability
      Version-key invalidation
      Indexes on resource + time
    Reliability
      Transactional outbox
      Fail-open when Redis is down
      Idempotent invalidation
    Scalability
      Stateless API instances
      SKIP LOCKED relay workers
    Observability
      Structured logs
      Traces (Jaeger)
